	JMS I	(ZAPONE)		/CALL SINGLE ZAP ROUTINE
	CHTBL+4				/SET <ESC> ENTRY
	.-.				/TO PASSED VALUE

ESCRET,	JMS I	(ZAPONE)		/CALL SINGLE ZAP ROUTINE
