	TAD	L7600/[CLA!400]		/GET CLEARING INSTRUCTION
	DCA I	(PZAP2+RBAK-BACKSP)	/PREVENT PRINTING SECOND CHARACTER
	TAD	L7600/[CLA!400]		/GET CLEARING INSTRUCTION
