	JMP I	.+1/(CHLOOP)	/GO BACK FOR MORE
	CHLOOP			/THROUGH HERE

	ZBLOCK	PRMPCNT-.	/EMPTY SPACE

PRMPCNT,NL0001/OR NL0002	/PROMPT COUNT INSTRUCTION FOR BACKUP MODES

RNRMEND,RELOC			/RESTORE ORIGIN
/	IMAGE OF CODE FOR SET RUBOUT BACKUP.

